# ✅ 4. Dockerize the Application

## Create `Dockerfile`

```dockerfile
FROM nginx:alpine
COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
EXPOSE 80
```

---

## Build Docker Image

```bash
docker build -t university-web .
```

---

## Run Container

```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:80 university-web
```

👉 Open browser:
`http://localhost:8080`

---

# ✅ 5. Kubernetes Deployment

Create a file: **deployment.yaml**

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: university-deployment
spec:
  replicas: 2
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: university
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: university
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: university-container
        image: university-web
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80
```

---

## Create Service → `service.yaml`

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: university-service
spec:
  type: NodePort
  selector:
    app: university
  ports:
    - protocol: TCP
      port: 80
      targetPort: 80
      nodePort: 30007
```

---

## Deploy to Kubernetes

```bash
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f service.yaml
```

---

## Check status

```bash
kubectl get pods
kubectl get services
```

👉 Open in browser:

```
http://localhost:30007
```

