# ✅ 6. Jenkins Pipeline Setup

## Install Plugins

* Docker
* Kubernetes
* Pipeline

---

## Create Jenkins Pipeline Job

### Pipeline Script:

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {

        stage('Clone Repo') {
            steps {
                git 'https://github.com/your-username/university-webpage.git'
            }
        }

        stage('Build Docker Image') {
            steps {
                sh 'docker build -t university-web .'
            }
        }

        stage('Run Container') {
            steps {
                sh 'docker run -d -p 8081:80 university-web || true'
            }
        }

        stage('Deploy to Kubernetes') {
            steps {
                sh 'kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml'
                sh 'kubectl apply -f service.yaml'
            }
        }
    }
}
```

